window.products.push({"id":669096,"name":"Beautifur Genuine Mongolian (Tibetan) Lamb Fur Wool Rectangular Throw Pillow Cushion Beige with Snow Top Two-tone 12\"x20\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IshhVYMrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This beautiful very soft and comfy pillow/cushion is made from the best quality genuine Mongolian/Tibetan lambskin fur, Beige with Snow Top two-tone in color. It is perfect for home décor, you can place it at any of your living space, on your bed, sofa, to wooden or carpet floor, or on chairs... they will definitely make a space look warm and inviting. ** 1. Color showed in the pictures may be slightly different from the real item due to the camera light reflection, and the shiny fur reflects different colors when it is under different lights, and they looked different in day time and night time too, pls see the difference of the colors showed in pictures we took under different lights. 2. Since these pillows are original made from lambskins, the fur length or shape on each pillow maybe a little bit different or uneven here and there since we don't cut the fur short. And also the leather back may look a little bit rough or have stitches to sew on the patches. Pls understand these imperfections are because of the nature of the animal skin. If perfection is what you concern, pls email and let us know what you need before buying. Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IshhVYMrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beautifur","source_asin":"B00X502CX0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-669096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00X502CX0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00X502CX0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
