window.products.push({"id":669109,"name":"HomeDesign's Dorm Room Bed Skirt - College Dorm Bed Skirt - Long Bed Skirt Dorm - Extra Long Dorm Room Bed Skirt - 100% Microfiber - White - Twin-XL -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pS+2MsTrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Invite HomeDesign's products into your home for their form and function, and experience their style, craftsmanship, and value. We used the best materials and designs for HomeDesign's products and use the most sensible manufacturing methods. We thoroughly have quality check for each of HomeDesign's product and rely on our customers feedback to help us deliver the best quality products. Dorm Sized Bed Skirt Twin XL (3 Panel Set) – Complete your college dorm room decor! A great way to add style to your college dorm room is with your unique extra-long Twin bedding. Your Twin XL size bed will most likely be the biggest piece of college furniture, so the way it looks can make or break the overall appearance of your dorm room. An essential college bed skirt will add extra style to your Twin extra-long bedding and dorm decor. This set of three sided dorm sized bed skirt panels has the perfect appearance for your dorm room. These machine washable dorm bed skirt panels feature an eye-catching colors, letting you make a statement with your dorm bedding and your college decor as a whole! Plus, easy to use fabric ties make it simple to add these college bedskirt panels to your Twin XL bed. Frequently Asked Questions About Our Dorm Sized Bed Skirts Why do I need a longer bed skirt for my college bed? Since the average dorm bed is constructed with extra height for college students to make use of helpful underbed storage, we designed this bed skirt panels. Shorter bed skirts won't be long enough to reach the floor from your Twin XL dorm bed frame, but the extra-long drop of this bed skirt can cover all your underbed storage on your taller than average dorm bed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pS+2MsTrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeDesign's","source_asin":"B099XB628W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-669109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099XB628W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099XB628W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
