window.products.push({"id":669127,"name":"CAVLA Graduation Gnome Window Clings 9 Sheets 2021 Graduation Gnome Grad Cap Diploma Star Window Stickers Decals Decorations for Grad Home Office Scho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KV-F1uf9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These cute graduation gnome window clings will make your windows look more beautifu on graduation party. Hope you enjoy your time to decorate your windows with your friends and families. Specifications: - Material: Electrostatic membrane PVC - Quantity: 9 sheets graduation gnome window clings, each gnome is about 10.6 inch tall. - Size: Each sheets measures 11.8 inch x 7.9 inch - Easy to use for any smooth surface, stick it all by themselves, good stickiness for a long time. - Reusable and durable for next year use. - NO CLUE, NO TAPE, NO MESS. Clear and Vibrant Colors Clear and vibrant print colors on these graduation elements like big gnomes, grad cap, diploma, star, success key, 2021, graduation uniforms, tie, etc will definitely add happy feelings to your house. Perfect choice to decorate your home, classroom, wall, party decoration in graduation, wherever you want to create a festive happy graduation atmosphere. Double Sides Prints These cute graduation window decals, are double-side printed, so you can see the image from both sides of the window, look so adorable on the windows or glass door, your sweetie will be happy with the window clings and can't move eyes from them. Large Gnome Graduation Window Clings Each sheets measures 11.8 inch X 7.9 inch, them can be clearly seen on the window no matter from inside or outside. How to use? 1. Make sure the surface is smooth and without any texture. Or the air will into the gap between the clings and surface then make the clings fall off. 2. Clean the surface to make sure there is no dust and grease on the surface. 3. Spray a little water on the surface. Water will make them stick better. 4. Put the clings on and remove the remaining water. Keep in mind these stickers are non-adhesive! These won't stick to most walls unless the finish is very glossy. Package Inclu","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KV-F1uf9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAVLA","source_asin":"B08Y8TPRZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-669127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y8TPRZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y8TPRZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":669128,"name":"Nautical Wall Decor Sailing Boats Clipper Ship Maritime Picture Art Print Poster (16x20)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MYgujFLWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"“A ship in harbor is safe but, that is not what ships are for” If you feel empty and lonely by viewing your dull walls then refill our surrounding with sailboat posters and prints poster. A clipper was a very fast sailing ship of the middle third of the 19th century. They were yacht-like vessels, with three masts and a square rig. They were generally narrow for their length, small by later 19th century standards, could carry limited bulk freight, and had a large total sail area. Clipper ships were mostly constructed in British and American shipyards, through France, Brazil, the Netherlands and other nations also produced some. Clippers sailed all over the world. It adds a contemporary charm to your décor pattern. Hurry up! Grab this wonderful wall poster for its durable quality and high degree of color accuracy. Make your order today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MYgujFLWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Impact Posters Gallery","source_asin":"B01BLD63ZA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-669128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BLD63ZA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BLD63ZA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
