window.products.push({"id":669223,"name":"WYGETGK Space Heater, Portable Space Heater 1500W/750W, Personal Heater with Overheating Protection & Tipping Protection, Safe and Quiet-Perfect for H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fHUwvxfFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: 🔥 Ceramic fan heater is a kind of heating appliance that uses electricity to heat ceramics and radiates the heat through a fan, also known as ceramic heater. 🔥 Unlike other heating appliances, it does not use fire, gas, or oil, so it is safe and does not pollute the air. The characteristic of the electric heater is that the hot air comes out immediately and the temperature is very high. 🔥 It is very suitable for changing rooms and other places that need to be heated immediately and kitchens! Automatically descend. There is an electronic anti-tilt switch inside the ceramic heater. When the device is tilted or tipped over, the heater will automatically turn off. In the event of an earthquake, families with children, pets or elderly people can use it with peace of mind. 🔥 It is light and compact. Exquisite and concise design, easy to use. It is very useful in changing rooms, doorways, offices and other places where large heating equipment cannot be placed. 🔥 Safe and energy-saving, no peculiar smell. Because there is no fuel such as kerosene or gas, there is no unpleasant smell. The heat came out as soon as the power was turned on. Spend the cold winter comfortably. 🔥 No need for ventilation, no toxic exhaust gas, no need for frequent ventilation. There is no need to refuel because electricity generates heat and heats the air in the room. Product specifications: ☀Model: 1500h1 ☀Item scratches: 15*15*26cm ☀Power supply: AC100V 50/60Hz ☀Power consumption: 5 ~ 1500w ☀Safety function: anti-temperature rise device, thermal fuse ☀Automatic power-off material: ABS fireproof material ☀Power cord length: 1.5m ☀Weight: about 1.5kg Warning: ❆Do not let children use it as a toy to avoid burns. ❆Do not touch the metal grille (vent) when the heater is working to avoid burns. ❆Do not block the air inlet and keep it at least 10 cm away from the wall or other objects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fHUwvxfFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WYGETGK","source_asin":"B09JKKLZ38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-669223","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JKKLZ38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JKKLZ38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":669224,"name":"PackIt Freezable Salad Bag, Dots","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91X8xf9mygL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pack salads and eat healthy with this clever lunch bag alternative that chills food on the go. This innovative salad cooler features PackIt’s groundbreaking cooling technology. Freezable gel is built into the walls of the cooler so there’s no need for separate ice packs or gel packs. To use, simply flatten the bag and place the entire bag in the freezer overnight. In the morning, the walls of the cooler will be completely frozen and ready to chill for hours. Pack healthy salads that would spoil in other bags or side dishes and desserts to bring to parties and potlucks. The wide design is ideal for large, rectangular containers and its top buckle handle helps you carry it upright and avoid spills. This salad cooler measures 8 inches square and stands 4.2 inches tall and takes up minimal space when folded. This soft sided bag is made from nontoxic poly canvas and has a food-safe, water-resistant lining. Like all PackIt products, the Salad Bag is made from PVC-, BPA-, phthalate-, formaldehyde- and lead-free materials. Simple care: wipe thoroughly or hand wash the interior and spot clean exterior; allow bag to dry completely before freezing. Not machine or dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91X8xf9mygL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PackIt","source_asin":"B00IZCWWP6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-669224","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IZCWWP6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IZCWWP6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
