window.products.push({"id":669311,"name":"Ultimate Liner Multi Header Lining Window Dressing 45 x 56 in White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u0idvoGBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Collection by Thermaplus® is best suited for homeowners who want to keep their existing curtains and convert them into 100% total blackouts. The is a ready to use curtain liner constructed with multiple layers of foam. Pairing it with your favorite curtain will create a hotel quality 100% true, total blackout environment. It will provide absolute privacy, cut heating and cooling costs, as well as dampen sound. Thermaplus® curtain liners utilize a special technique of bonding multiple layers of foam to each panel. This non-toxic and odorless layered foam is applied with a white finish to ensure that the meets condo guidelines and reflects sunlight. Moreover, this layering will cut your energy consumption costs by reducing drafts during the winter, trapping in the warmth, and keeping the cold out. You will also conserve energy during the summer by blocking and reflecting the sun's heat keeping your home cooler and more comfortable. The added insulation dampens noise from outside, which is especially useful for those working unusual hours or consider themselves light sleepers. Finally, these liners will block harmful UV rays, which can fade your floors and damage your furniture. When properly installed, any Thermaplus® blackout product will block 100% of all incoming light. They create the ideal conditions for a restful night's sleep, providing you with total day and nighttime privacy and blocking the glare of street and car headlights. The liner is made of a blend of 80% polyester and 20% cotton. The insulated foam backing is a blend of 56% cotton, 44% rayon. These quality materials are long-lasting, easy to clean, and resistant to wrinkles. Simply machine wash in cold water on a gentle cycle, and hang to dry. The package contains one 45\" wide panel liner intended to be attached or hung, depending on the curtain header, flat or with some fullness to the back of a curtain panel. The 45-inch width of curtain liner is compatible with any curtain with a 40\" to 54\" width. For a total 100% blackout experience and a quick and easy installation, a 56-inch length curtain liner best fits with a curtain up to a 63-inch length. Thermaplus® products are composed of superior quality fabrics that pass rigorous quality control standards, faithfully ensuring that they block 100% of incoming light.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81u0idvoGBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thermalogic","source_asin":"B09B1QWFKJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-669311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B1QWFKJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B1QWFKJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
