window.products.push({"id":669390,"name":"ARTISTEM 18\" Artificial Eucalyptus Stems, Faux Greenery for Coffee Table Decor Farmhouse Home Decor Wedding Decor and Wreath Making Fake Plants Leaves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lh0-CaYJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌿YOU WILL RECEIVE: The package includes 10 single stems and 2 bunches of 7 stems. Two types of eucalyptus stems are in separate plastic bags and protected by three soft plastic caps on the end of the branches wrapped in a zipper closure bag. Fake plants may have a smell when you just received them, leaving them in the vent for 1-2 days to remove the odor. 🌿DIMENSION AND MATERIAL: Faux eucalyptus stems are made from high-quality plastic and wire. The stems are about 18 inches high, each stem has 17 pairs of leaves from large to small. The outer layer of the leaves and stem is plastic, and inside of the stem is a wire that you can bend into any shape or cut any height you want. 🌿GLAUCOUS LEAVES: There is a layer of white frost on the surface of the eucalyptus leaves, not dust, not sprayed on, due to the natural growth of the special material, when you first get it will be less, with the passage of time, will be more. If you feel a bit fake, you can soak it in water for one or two hours, take it out and dry it, which will accelerate the appearance of white frost. 🌿VIVID AND NATURAL: These eucalyptus decors are non-toxic, environmentally friendly, may have a slight odor it will be gone after some time, not easily broken, vivid, veins of the leaves are visible, no plastic feeling due to the presence of a layer of white frost. 🌿VARIOUS USE COMBINATIONS: Artificial eucalyptus can be used with other decorations: wedding centerpieces, home, coffee tables, restaurant, balcony, garden, wherever you are inspired. Fake eucalyptus will not wither without the need for plant care. They are also ideal for a DIY bouquet, flower table arrangements, eucalyptus wreath, garland.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lh0-CaYJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARTISTEM","source_asin":"B09NR8JNPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-669390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NR8JNPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NR8JNPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
