window.products.push({"id":669396,"name":"Three Dragons 5.5’’ Utility Knife - Tiger Eye Series - Paring Knives German High Carbon Steel with Pakkawood Grip, One-piece with a Closed Bolster Col","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615nME5kHtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"About the three dragon knives I am born in a city renowned for knife crafting for nearly 1500 years. I have an inseparable fate with the knife, just like the food can not be missing the Premier knife. I know the funny role of the knife in the kitchen, so the production of each chef knife The craft is strictly controlled by us. The meaning of \"Three Dragons\" is that the dragons take off, like every sharp knife flying in the hands of the chef. We can't live up to the food and can't live up to the users of the three dragon knives. Why choose this chef knife? The Three Dragon Tiger Eye Series 5'' Paring Knife is a must-have for anyone who likes cooking. This chef's blade is precision forged from premium high-carbon German steel, ensuring ultra-sharp edges, abrasion resistance and stain resistance. Hand sharpened 15-16 degrees that easily finish ultra-thin slicing and cutting with minimal effort. Beautiful striped colorful pakkawood handles with anti-slip design for maximum comfort and operability. The knife has a pleasing grip, a balance of perfect design and a satisfactory weight. Hand-polished bolsters add weight and provide finger protection. Ideal Multipurpose Cutlery Gift (Christmas, Weddings, Birthdays, Fathers Day, Mothers Day) This is exactly the kitchen companion you need. SPECIFICATIONS : *Blade Length: 5.5inch * Handle Length: 4.5inch * Total Knife Length:10inch * Blade Thickness: 2.5mm * Weight: 3.9oz (110g) * Packaged Securely: 1pc* 5.5inch Paring Knife 1pc* Premium Gift Box Warming Tips - Hand wash is recommended Not dishwasher safe - Please do not use for bone cutting and chopping - Please do not use to cut metal or glass - Immediately wash and dry the knife after use - Keep away from children - Please store the knife to a clean & dry place","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615nME5kHtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Three Dragons","source_asin":"B07Q99NP56","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-669396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q99NP56","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q99NP56","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
