window.products.push({"id":669418,"name":"Fruit Basket with Banana Hanger, Fruit Bowl for Kitchen Counter, 3 Tier, Glass Ripening Container, Acacia Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818zF-VW0aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ORIGINAL DESIGN: A tiered fruit bowl that ensures fruit ripen just right! The beautifully carved tree hangs bananas up above a wooden bowl of ripe fruit that covers a specially designed glass compartment to ripen avocados. Packaged in a beautifully designed box, this makes a great gift! RIPEN AVOCADOS: Can't wait for avocados to ripen? Well, we have optimized the natural process of ripening! Fruit releases a natural gas called ethylene gas as it begins to ripen. When placed in the glass container with the wooden lid the gases build up and through the specially designed wooden vents the flow of etheylene gas is regulated to speed up the ripening process. You'll have ripe avocados in no time! PREMIUM QUALITY: The finest quality materials have been used. A handmade crystal glass bowl designed with a sturdy flat surface allowing for stability to hold large amounts of fruit. The wooden bowl can be used as a removable stand-alone bowl whilst the banana tree can support a surprisingly large bunch of bananas. SAVE SPACE: Free up counter space and organize your fruit across 3 tiers, in a beautiful display of colour. The wooden bowl measures 11.8 inches in diameter allowing for an assortment of fruit to be stored. The banana hanger is strong and sturdy and will hold up to 2 large bunches, whilst the glass bowl will hold a minimum of 4 large avocados. EASY ASSEMBLY: The tree is flat packed in the box and is easily attached to the wooden bowl with 4 hex screws and key that are included. An instruction manual is enclosed for a quick and straightforward assembly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818zF-VW0aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Verre","source_asin":"B08PPM7LVS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-669418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PPM7LVS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PPM7LVS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
