window.products.push({"id":669577,"name":"Tart Pan with Removable Bottom,10 Inch Quiche Pans and 4 Inch Mini Tart Pan Set,Non-Stick Coating with Loose Bottom Ideal for Pies, Cheese Cakes,Tarts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618vIO1P23S._AC_SL1004_.jpg","description":"【Perfect Pie Pan Set】You will get a 9-piece tart pan set, which are 1*10-inch tart pan, 6*4-inch tart pans, 1 grease brush, and 1 silicone spatula. When you want to make delicious desserts for your family and friends, COSVER's tart pan set can meet your needs. With two sizes of quiche pans, you can make the size pie you want. Buy now and start your happy time of making delicious desserts! 【Removable Bottom, Easy to Release】The 10-inch and 4-inch tart pan are designed with removable bottoms, so that your delicious food can be easily removed from the mold, and the food can be kept intact and beautiful. At the same time can speed up the food cooling speed, so you can enjoy delicious food faster. 【Easy to Clean】The surface coating treatment of each tart pan is non-stick on both sides. The bottom is removable, easy and convenient to clean without leaving any food residue. Clean with a soft cloth or sponge brush, do not use sharp metal tools to wipe, so as not to damage the coating. (Warm tip: To extend the life of the pie pan, we recommend that you wash the pan by hand, not in the dishwasher.) 【Suitable for All Kinds of Cuisines and Places】The 4-inch tart pan is perfect for baking mini pies, tarts or making mini cakes.10-inch is suitable for making quiche, pies, pizzas and other delicious desserts. Round bottom removable quiche pan is not only popular in our daily life, but also suitable for restaurants,bakeries,buffets,gifts for formal occasions,such as weddings,Mother's Day,Valentine's Day, birthday parties,housewarming celebrations, etc. 【Safe and Healthy Material】The tart pan is made of high quality food grade carbon steel, which is sturdy and durable and provides excellent heat transfer for evenly baked food. The surface of the tart pan is coated with food safe non-stick coating, and the edges of the product are carefully polished to make it smooth and prevent cutting, making it safer to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618vIO1P23S._AC_SL1004_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSVER","source_asin":"B096JZSLJJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-669577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096JZSLJJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096JZSLJJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
