window.products.push({"id":669893,"name":"Stock Your Home Plastic Storage Jars (6 Pack) - 32 Oz Square Plastic Canisters with Lids - Shatterproof Plastic Storage Jars with Lids - Reusable Wide","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ilbfthlJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Proudly Made in the USA: Store cookies, candies, chocolates, pretzels, popcorn, snacks, and more in our 32-ounce square plastic storage jars. Made of premium quality PET plastic, our jars are reusable and recyclable. Our value pack comes with 6 square containers with 6 white plastic screw-on caps. Each of our plastic canisters with lids has a maximum capacity of 32-ounces. Dimensions are approximately 3.78\" L x 3.78\" W x 5.27\" H. Lid measures 89 mm. *Not dishwasher safe. Easy Grip Handle: Our square clear plastic container with lids are constructed with an easy grip handle. The square shape makes our containers easily stackable and a great space saver for your pantry, office space, and more! Our jar also features a 89mm wide-mouth opening, making it easy to access and refill the contents of the jar. Leak-Proof Caps: Our white 89-400 PP caps are made with a ribbed sided design to make unscrewing and securing the lid easy. Each cap has a liner, making them leak-proof and spill resistant. The tight seal keeps food fresh and long lasting. It also keeps bad-odors from permeating the contents of the plastic storage jars. Shatter-Proof: Our square plastic jars have a modern, crystal clear design similar to glass, without the worry of it breaking or shattering. This makes our plastic canisters with lids a safe choice for parents with toddlers or babies, grandparents, elderly family members, and more. Our plastic storage jars with lids are easy to clean. Wash by hand with warm water, mild dish soap, and a non-abrasive sponge. *Heat from the dishwasher can cause plastic to distort or melt. *Not* dishwasher safe. Versatile: Perfect for pantry goods like coffee beans, keurig coffee pods, tea bags, cereal, grains, and pasta. Use them to store children’s toys like small action figures, lego blocks, and puzzle pieces. They’re also great for organizing pens, markers, cotton balls, laundry detergent pods, and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ilbfthlJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stock Your Home","source_asin":"B0BD9GFZQN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-669893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD9GFZQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD9GFZQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
