window.products.push({"id":669943,"name":"Leggett & Platt Argyle Complete Metal Bed and Steel Support Frame with Diamond Pattern Top Rail and Double Spindle Castings, Copper Chrome Finish, Kin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711D9rKfNiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Argyle is named for the diamond pattern wire design casted in this bedroom piece that will take the focal point of any master suite or guestroom. Constructed of carbon steel for stability and years of everyday use, the 56-inch headboard and 36-inch footboard are detailed with (5) sets of double spindles casted together. The Copper Chrome finish is a mixture of copper and silver streaked with black antiquing, which will allow the bed to coordinate with many types of wood accessory pieces. There’s a curved piece of metal tube added to the bottom of the footboard to provide a bit of additional flair to the design. Round finial bedposts and aluminum castings complete this stylish look. The engineered bed frame consists of iron rails, cross arms and glides to provide full support to your mattress and box spring. A good ornamental bed will fuse with the surrounding décor, accent other bedroom furniture and transform an ordinary room into something interesting and sophisticated. This unit includes a headboard and footboard panel, bed frame, instruction sheet, and hardware bag with everything needed for easy assembly. The Leggett & Platt Argyle Complete Bed comes with a 10-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. Leggett & Platt Inc. is an industry leader in the production of adjustable bases, fashionable beds, bedding support, and top of bed textiles. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Leggett & Platt stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes, innovative designs, and technology to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value. Leggett & Platt Consumer Products: Value Without Compromise","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711D9rKfNiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B002HWRBJW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-669943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002HWRBJW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002HWRBJW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
