window.products.push({"id":669999,"name":"Cocktail Shaker, 16 Oz, Premium Stainless Steel Double Wall Insulated Drink Shaker with Built in Bartender Strainer (Professional Bar Tool)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZzfNXdCIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Defiance Tools 16 oz Insulated Cocktail Shaker is a must have for any mixologist or bartender. Especially those that enjoy mixing cocktails for friends and family, but don't like their hand getting frostbite from holding a standard cocktail shaker. Defiance Tools comes to the rescue with their 16 oz Insulated Cocktail Strainer made of double wall, vacuum sealed stainless steel. It keeps your hands warm and your drink cold for over 9 hours. This shaker features a jigger cap and a built in strainer, with a food grade silicone seal that's keeps the cocktail inside while you're shaking it. The 3.5\" opening in the 16 oz Insulated Cocktail Shaker is also big enough to stir a cocktail with a Hoffman spoon, if your customer prefers stirred... not shaken. For the serious mixologist, we recommend ordering the Defiance Tools 2 oz Bell Style Solid Base Jigger as well, so you can start to build a full professional set. SPECIFICATIONS: Made of 304 stainless steel Size – 3.5\" Diameter opening, 9.375\" Tall to the top of the jigger cap Capacity – 16 FL OZ (473 ml) Weight – 13.5 oz empty We recommend hand washing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZzfNXdCIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Defiance Tools","source_asin":"B07K5FD5WZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-669999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K5FD5WZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K5FD5WZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
